Notebook[{Cell["ComputeSubgroups", "ObjectName"], 
  Cell["ComputeSubgroups specifies whether a builder computes subgroups; the \
default is False.", "Usage"], Cell["Status: Alpha.", "Notes"], 
  Cell["Option for BuildGroup, BuildModularGroup and BuildGroupFromGAP. \
Default: False.", "Notes"], 
  Cell["True computes the selected subgroup collection during construction.", 
   "Notes"], Cell["Per-call shared settings override matching package \
configuration. The owning function rejects unsupported values before \
computation.", "Notes"], Cell["See Also", "SeeAlsoSection"], 
